 "remarks": "Attached one car garage plus off street parking in this picture perfect one bedroom ranch style unit in downtown Stamford. Located at the end of a quiet, cul de sac side street walking distance to just about everything. Open living room, dining room, kitchen combination. Hardwood and tile floors. Sliders off the dining room to your own private deck. Walk in closet in the bedroom. Oversized bathroom. Heat/AC unit replaced in 2024. Refrigerator, washer, dryer all within the past few years. Fresh paint throughout. Excellent credit required and no pets of any kind.",
